  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant VEHICLE_TYPE_SLED has the value 1</p>
  <p>Simple vehicle that bumps along the ground, and likes to move along it’s local x-axis.</p>
  <p>Setting the vehicle type to sled enables the vehicle system and additionally has the same effect of executing the following:</p>
</p>
    </div>

